OL,3,GNEWSANo bin collections for five months
OL,4,Ahas people 'living in their own waste'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are living among their "own
OL,7,Fwaste" on a new housing development
OL,8,Fwhere the bins have not been collected
OL,9,Fin five months, a homeowner has said.
OL,11,FNathan Long said living in their new
OL,12,Fhome on the Hawthorn Meadows estate in
OL,13,FBuckley, Flintshire, where a waste
OL,14,Fcollection system was still not in
OL,15,Fplace, had been a nightmare for his
OL,16,Fyoung family.
OL,18,FDeveloper Castle Green hired skips to
OL,19,Ftry to help residents suffering with
OL,20,Fpiled-up rubbish through the hottest
OL,21,Fsummer on record and called Flintshire
OL,22,Fcouncil the slowest it had worked with.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
