OL,3,GNEWSANo bin collections for five months
OL,4,Ahas people 'living in their own waste'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it was "aware of
OL,7,Fconcerns" and was "working to establish
OL,8,Fthe position regarding the occupied
OL,9,Fproperties at this development".
